WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:04.966
You guys look really great!

2
00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:07.966
It's a relief to see that you're all doing really well!

3
00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:11.433
Are you eating OK? Are you cleaning up after yourself?

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.333
I hope so! Is the laundry piling up? I hope not!

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:19.500
Everything's so completely under control, I've just completed my latest invention.

6
00:00:19.566 --> 00:00:21.000
Latest invention?

7
00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:25.633
With it, you'll never have to do household chores again!

8
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.800
I call it my Gothitelle Domestic Engineer!

9
00:00:28.866 --> 00:00:31.266
It automatically detects anything that needs cleaning

10
00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:33.966
and polishes it until it has an immaculate lustre!

11
00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:36.200
- Awesome!
- Pika.

12
00:00:36.266 --> 00:00:39.200
You are witnessing the power of science.

13
00:00:40.966 --> 00:00:42.866
- Hey, I don't need cleaning!
- Pika!

14
00:00:42.933 --> 00:00:46.133
Stop it! Cut it out!

15
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.266
I'll be glad when you get here.

16
00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:53.433
It'll be a relief, too.

17
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.933
Oh!

18
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

19
00:00:58.866 --> 00:01:00.633
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

20
00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.066
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

21
00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:05.533
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

22
00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.366
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

23
00:01:09.433 --> 00:01:12.633
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

24
00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:16.066
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

25
00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:20.033
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

26
00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:24.733
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

27
00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:27.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

28
00:01:29.866 --> 00:01:33.133
Good Friends, Great Training!

29
00:01:36.066 --> 00:01:39.200
Our heroes are on their way to Lumiose City,

30
00:01:39.266 --> 00:01:41.800
site of the battle for Ash's fifth Gym Badge,

31
00:01:41.866 --> 00:01:44.000
while Clemont waits for their arrival.

32
00:01:44.066 --> 00:01:45.900
Yay. I'm glad Clemont looks good,

33
00:01:45.966 --> 00:01:48.000
even if his inventions look about the same.

34
00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:49.100
He looks great!

35
00:01:49.166 --> 00:01:52.066
And he said he's been taking on challengers almost every day.

36
00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:54.200
Well this is one challenger he's not gonna beat.

37
00:01:54.266 --> 00:01:56.300
- What do you say, buddy?
- Pika!

38
00:01:56.366 --> 00:01:59.600
So have you come up with a strategy yet?

39
00:01:59.666 --> 00:02:01.700
- Strategy, huh?
- Right.

40
00:02:01.766 --> 00:02:04.466
You'd better think about Clemont's Pokémon and figure out

41
00:02:04.533 --> 00:02:06.300
- how you're going to battle them.
- Yeah.

42
00:02:06.366 --> 00:02:11.166
Now let's see. Clemont's Pokémon are Bunnelby and Chespin and Luxray, so...

43
00:02:11.233 --> 00:02:13.633
He's also got Magneton and Heliolisk.

44
00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.400
I'm sure they've been training really hard.

45
00:02:15.466 --> 00:02:17.533
- All right.
- Pika.

46
00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:20.400
- We'll train really hard, too!
- Special training?

47
00:02:20.466 --> 00:02:23.733
Huh? Who's there?

48
00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:30.533
- It's been a long time, hasn't it?
- It's Tierno!

49
00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.033
- What do you know? Hi!

50
00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:35.366
Bonnie and Dedenne. You look great!

51
00:02:35.433 --> 00:02:38.033
- Thanks!
- Serena! Ah!

52
00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:41.033
Your hair's different! Your clothes, too!

53
00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:43.166
- You've really changed your look!
- Uh...

54
00:02:43.233 --> 00:02:46.666
Wow. You looked great before, but now you look really great!

55
00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:50.133
- Perfecto!
- Uh, thanks a lot, Tierno!

56
00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:52.633
- Huh. Where's Clemont?
- Huh?

57
00:02:53.766 --> 00:02:56.966
No way! Clemont's a Gym Leader? No kidding?

58
00:02:57.033 --> 00:03:00.866
Yeah! And he's in Lumiose City now getting ready for our battle.

59
00:03:00.933 --> 00:03:04.066
I remember challenging the Lumiose City Gym once.

60
00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:06.200
But I know I didn't see Clemont.

61
00:03:07.333 --> 00:03:08.800
I battled some weird robot.

62
00:03:08.866 --> 00:03:13.433
You're talking about Clembot. Clemont built that robot himself.

63
00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:16.566
Are you serious? Incredible!

64
00:03:16.633 --> 00:03:21.066
- So, did you win a badge?
- Heh. You bet! And here it is.

65
00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:22.233
Way to go!

66
00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:25.433
So what do you say you have a battle with me right now?

67
00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:28.200
It'll be a great way to get in a little practice.

68
00:03:28.266 --> 00:03:30.766
- Pika, pika!
- You've got it!

69
00:03:32.933 --> 00:03:35.933
OK, Sliggoo! I choose you!

70
00:03:37.566 --> 00:03:38.566
Goo.

71
00:03:38.633 --> 00:03:40.933
That's awesome, that you caught a Sliggoo.

72
00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.300
Thanks!

73
00:03:42.366 --> 00:03:45.666
Sliggoo was kind of scared and a little timid at first.

74
00:03:45.733 --> 00:03:48.300
But special training's made it super-strong!

75
00:03:48.366 --> 00:03:51.600
Wow. Check my Pokémon!

76
00:03:54.733 --> 00:03:58.466
- A Ludicolo and a Wartortle!
- And Hitmontop and Politoed!

77
00:03:58.533 --> 00:04:02.533
See, I've been adding to my team since the summer camp. They're great!

78
00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:05.966
That Wartortle evolved from your Squirtle. Am I right?

79
00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:11.600
War...

80
00:04:11.666 --> 00:04:16.600
Ludicolo! Ludicolo! Ludicolo! Ludicolo!

81
00:04:17.533 --> 00:04:20.800
So, Ash, tell me what you think of my new dance crew now.

82
00:04:20.866 --> 00:04:23.300
Wow! They've got some great moves!

83
00:04:23.366 --> 00:04:26.566
Oh, yeah, did you wind up using my rhythmic battle style?

84
00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:31.233
Well, my style ended up being a little different than what you were showing me,

85
00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:34.300
but I used it to win a Rumble Badge at the Shalour Gym.

86
00:04:34.366 --> 00:04:38.700
Awesome! I know. I think we should have a double battle.

87
00:04:38.766 --> 00:04:42.733
My Pokémon will be Wartortle and my other buddy right here.

88
00:04:43.933 --> 00:04:46.766
- Rai!
- Cool! Raichu, huh?

89
00:04:46.833 --> 00:04:49.033
If you're gonna challenge the Lumiose Gym,

90
00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:51.500
you'd better do some training against Electric types.

91
00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:56.266
Raichu. The Mouse Pokémon, and the evolved form of Pikachu.

92
00:04:56.333 --> 00:04:58.533
Raichu's tail functions as a ground

93
00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:00.566
and releases electricity into the surface,

94
00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:02.300
which keeps it from shocking itself.

95
00:05:02.366 --> 00:05:05.800
Isn't that cute? Raichu is Pikachu's evolved form!

96
00:05:05.866 --> 00:05:08.533
- Denne-ne!
- Pikachu? Sliggoo?

97
00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:10.200
Let's give it all we've got!

98
00:05:10.266 --> 00:05:11.600
- Pika!
- Sliggoo.

99
00:05:11.666 --> 00:05:13.633
All right. Battle begin!

100
00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.833
-Huh?

101
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.466
- Pika, pika!
- Pikachu!

102
00:05:21.533 --> 00:05:23.366
- What's going on?
- Pikachu!

103
00:05:23.433 --> 00:05:25.500
- Let Pikachu go!
- Pika!

104
00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:30.100
Team Rocket? -Hi!

105
00:05:30.166 --> 00:05:34.400
I trust you're dumb as always. We're remotely coming to you from far away!

106
00:05:34.466 --> 00:05:35.933
Wobba, wobba!

107
00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:39.500
And now, witness the sheer power of Team Rocket's newest robot,

108
00:05:39.566 --> 00:05:43.100
the Automatic Pikachu Catcher, otherwise known as APC!

109
00:05:43.166 --> 00:05:45.966
Our APC is capable of long-distance performance

110
00:05:46.033 --> 00:05:49.300
by detecting the electricity in Pikachu's body from any location

111
00:05:49.366 --> 00:05:51.433
and then catching the twerpy rascal.

112
00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.400
All right, show us your magic, APC!

113
00:05:58.133 --> 00:06:00.433
- Pika, pika.
- Not gonna happen.

114
00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:02.866
Sliggoo! Dragon Breath, right now!

115
00:06:02.933 --> 00:06:04.766
- Sliggoo!
- Pika!

116
00:06:04.833 --> 00:06:09.300
- Uh! Pikachu, you OK?
- Pikachu.

117
00:06:13.666 --> 00:06:16.566
- Rai.
- Tor.

118
00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:22.433
-Raichu and Wartortle!

119
00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:25.033
- Pikachu. Sliggoo. Help them out!
- Pika!

120
00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:27.133
Pika!

121
00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:29.900
-Oh!

122
00:06:32.966 --> 00:06:34.400
- Tortle!
- Goo!

123
00:06:34.466 --> 00:06:35.933
Rai!

124
00:06:38.366 --> 00:06:40.100
Come back!

125
00:06:47.033 --> 00:06:49.333
- Huh?
- Oh, no...

126
00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:00.166
- Rai!
- Tortle.

127
00:07:09.666 --> 00:07:12.433
- War war.
- Rai, rai, rai.

128
00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.866
Wartortle, tortle, tortle.

129
00:07:18.366 --> 00:07:20.700
Fletch! Fletch! Fletchinder!

130
00:07:20.766 --> 00:07:22.900
- Fletchinder!
- See anything?

131
00:07:22.966 --> 00:07:27.700
Flechinder, chinder. All right. Thanks a lot, Fletchinder.

132
00:07:30.533 --> 00:07:32.900
I think we should split up and look separately.

133
00:07:32.966 --> 00:07:35.433
Good idea. So let's get going!

134
00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.133
- OK!
- All right!

135
00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:38.733
Bonnie? You can come with me!

136
00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:40.100
Uh, sure!

137
00:07:40.166 --> 00:07:42.300
If we find them, we'll meet back here, all right?

138
00:07:42.366 --> 00:07:43.566
OK!

139
00:07:45.066 --> 00:07:46.966
Yumbo!

140
00:07:47.033 --> 00:07:48.600
Hm?

141
00:07:48.666 --> 00:07:52.100
- It swipes like a charm!
- Hm.

142
00:07:52.166 --> 00:07:56.200
Now we can relax and do all our important work at the same time.

143
00:07:56.266 --> 00:08:00.166
It's important for evil geniuses like us to work smart, not hard.

144
00:08:00.233 --> 00:08:01.666
Wobbuffet.

145
00:08:01.733 --> 00:08:04.366
This new APC technology will help us

146
00:08:04.433 --> 00:08:08.333
catch plenty of Pokémon besides Pikachu and...

147
00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:13.733
Hmm. Ah! I was wrong! It's a Raichu instead!

148
00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.266
What's all the yelling about?

149
00:08:17.966 --> 00:08:21.133
Ah! Our Pikachu!

150
00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:23.266
All right, where's our Pikachu, huh?

151
00:08:23.333 --> 00:08:25.466
- Think it evolved?
- I highly doubt it.

152
00:08:25.533 --> 00:08:27.633
But that doesn't explain this...

153
00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.133
Raichu!

154
00:08:30.966 --> 00:08:33.600
Uh!

155
00:08:35.033 --> 00:08:36.966
No, no, no!

156
00:08:37.033 --> 00:08:40.733
The Thunderbolt that normally zaps us has tons more fizz than that bomb.

157
00:08:40.799 --> 00:08:43.666
Hey, I got it! The APC made a mistake.

158
00:08:43.733 --> 00:08:48.133
It made its move based on the similar juice Pikachu usually dishes out!

159
00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:49.933
And what's that?

160
00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.600
Wartortle!

161
00:08:51.666 --> 00:08:54.233
- Yikes!

162
00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:59.000
No one flattens my hair! Pumpkaboo, Shadow Ball!

163
00:08:59.066 --> 00:09:00.933
Pumpka!

164
00:09:02.533 --> 00:09:05.466
Come back!

165
00:09:05.533 --> 00:09:07.266
- Aah!
- Huh?

166
00:09:09.266 --> 00:09:12.366
Ugh! That's what happens when you mess with me.

167
00:09:12.433 --> 00:09:14.900
But, Jess, they just rolled out of here.

168
00:09:14.966 --> 00:09:17.833
- We had them where we wanted them.
- Aah!

169
00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:20.700
All I care is to catch Pikachu.

170
00:09:20.766 --> 00:09:24.833
And we're going to grab hold of that twerpish troublemaker or else!

171
00:09:26.366 --> 00:09:28.933
Go! Find that Pikachu, now!

172
00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.500
Careful. Watch your step.

173
00:09:33.566 --> 00:09:36.433
Don't worry. I'm careful. It's fine!

174
00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:39.766
-Something just fell back there!

175
00:09:42.366 --> 00:09:44.333
Goo?

176
00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:46.833
Sliggoo! Sliggoo!

177
00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:49.900
- Tor, tortle.
- Rai...

178
00:09:49.966 --> 00:09:52.100
- Look! It's Sliggoo!
- Goo?

179
00:09:52.166 --> 00:09:55.066
- Yay!
- Wartortle! Raichu! What a relief!

180
00:09:55.133 --> 00:09:58.366
- Wartortle, tortle, tortle.
- Rai!

181
00:09:58.433 --> 00:10:01.233
- Denne-ne-ne!
- Goo! Goo, goo, Sliggoo!

182
00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:05.333
So you fell from up there, huh? I'm so glad you're all right.

183
00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:07.800
Hey. Where's Team Rocket's robot?

184
00:10:07.866 --> 00:10:09.533
Didn't it fall down with you?

185
00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:12.400
- Slig, Sliggoo!
- Wait a minute.

186
00:10:12.466 --> 00:10:15.933
Remember, that awful machine can pick up on Pikachu's electricity.

187
00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:18.366
- So maybe it's chasing Pikachu!
- Goo.

188
00:10:18.433 --> 00:10:21.166
Then that means Ash and the others are in trouble too!

189
00:10:21.233 --> 00:10:23.466
- We've got to find them!
- Huh? Wait!

190
00:10:23.533 --> 00:10:27.033
Just leave everything to us. Dedenne, ready?

191
00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:28.566
Denne!

192
00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:31.166
Denne!

193
00:10:31.233 --> 00:10:33.733
Dedenne can sense Pikachu's electricity!

194
00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:36.666
And that means Dedenne can find out where Pikachu is!

195
00:10:36.733 --> 00:10:39.733
- Wow, Dedenne can do that?
- Denne-ne!

196
00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:42.600
- Dedenne knows already!
- Really?

197
00:10:47.066 --> 00:10:49.300
Who's that Pokémon?

198
00:10:54.066 --> 00:10:56.700
It's Sliggoo!

199
00:10:56.766 --> 00:10:58.333
Sliggoo!

200
00:11:02.666 --> 00:11:06.600
Hey, Sliggoo? Wartortle? Raichu?

201
00:11:06.666 --> 00:11:08.633
Answer if you can hear me!

202
00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:13.100
- Pika! Pika!
- They don't seem to be in the area.

203
00:11:13.166 --> 00:11:15.600
Pikachu!

204
00:11:15.666 --> 00:11:18.366
- What's up, Pikachu?
- Pika, pika!

205
00:11:18.433 --> 00:11:20.666
Right! It's Dedenne's electricity!

206
00:11:20.733 --> 00:11:22.400
I wonder if something happened...

207
00:11:22.466 --> 00:11:23.533
- Huh?

208
00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:29.233
The robot! Careful, Pikachu!

209
00:11:30.366 --> 00:11:32.433
- Pikachu! Iron Tail!
- Pika!

210
00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.900
Chu! Pika, pika!

211
00:11:38.566 --> 00:11:41.833
All right! Let's go! Pikachu.

212
00:11:42.533 --> 00:11:45.933
- Oh.
- We'll never get over that...

213
00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.233
Sli, sli.

214
00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:49.133
Sliggoo!

215
00:11:53.933 --> 00:11:58.133
- No good.
- Hm. Sliggoo!

216
00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:01.466
Sliggoo! Sliggoo!

217
00:12:01.533 --> 00:12:02.633
-Sliggoo!

218
00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.966
- Sliggoo, please! Stop!
- Sliggoo!

219
00:12:05.033 --> 00:12:09.100
- Unbelievable. Sliggoo's amazing.
- Sliggoo! Sliggoo!

220
00:12:09.166 --> 00:12:12.000
Wartortle, Raichu! Help Sliggoo out!

221
00:12:12.066 --> 00:12:13.633
- War.
- Rai.

222
00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:16.133
Goo! Sliggoo!

223
00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:18.633
- Wartortle.
- Raichu.

224
00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:20.366
Sliggoo!

225
00:12:24.433 --> 00:12:26.166
- All right!
- Heh. Yay!

226
00:12:26.233 --> 00:12:27.866
Sliggoo!

227
00:12:27.933 --> 00:12:31.200
Pikachu!

228
00:12:34.666 --> 00:12:36.566
Pikachu. Pi, pi, pika, pika!

229
00:12:36.633 --> 00:12:39.600
- Pikachu!
- Pika!

230
00:12:41.833 --> 00:12:44.766
Team Rocket! That's my Pikachu!

231
00:12:44.833 --> 00:12:47.533
Prepare for trouble, I disagree!

232
00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:49.766
And make it double, it works for me!

233
00:12:49.833 --> 00:12:52.266
To protect the world from devastation!

234
00:12:52.333 --> 00:12:55.200
To unite all people within our nation!

235
00:12:55.266 --> 00:12:58.033
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

236
00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:01.533
To extend our reach to the stars above!

237
00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:03.400
- Jessie!
- And James.

238
00:13:03.466 --> 00:13:06.800
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

239
00:13:06.866 --> 00:13:09.866
Surrender now or prepare for a state-of-the-art fight!

240
00:13:09.933 --> 00:13:11.933
Meowth, that's right!

241
00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:13.433
Wobbuffet!

242
00:13:14.633 --> 00:13:17.733
Remember, please and thank you are called the magic words.

243
00:13:17.800 --> 00:13:21.400
But even polite banter means nothing from a bunch of twerpy tots.

244
00:13:21.466 --> 00:13:24.866
Right! We've got Pikachu and we're not afraid to use it!

245
00:13:24.933 --> 00:13:26.500
Wobbuffet.

246
00:13:28.466 --> 00:13:31.166
Pikachu!

247
00:13:31.233 --> 00:13:33.733
-You saved Pikachu! Great!

248
00:13:36.066 --> 00:13:38.300
- Pika, pika!
- Sliggoo!

249
00:13:39.433 --> 00:13:41.333
It's Ash and Serena!

250
00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:44.766
Unh! Argh! You twerpish brats!

251
00:13:44.833 --> 00:13:47.133
Pumpkaboo, Shadow Ball!

252
00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:49.900
Kaboo! Kaboo!

253
00:13:49.966 --> 00:13:52.866
Look out! Dodge it!

254
00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:58.800
- Ah. What was that?
- Yipes! That smarts!

255
00:13:58.866 --> 00:14:00.900
- Owee.
- This always happens!

256
00:14:06.833 --> 00:14:08.266
- Goo!
- Pikachu!

257
00:14:08.333 --> 00:14:10.333
Aah!

258
00:14:11.333 --> 00:14:14.500
Ash, no! Serena! Ah!

259
00:14:15.333 --> 00:14:18.100
- Aah!
- Sliggoo!

260
00:14:18.166 --> 00:14:20.433
- Ah.
- Oh, no, Ash!

261
00:14:22.166 --> 00:14:24.200
Seviper!

262
00:14:30.333 --> 00:14:32.433
Wooper!

263
00:14:37.366 --> 00:14:38.900
Goo!

264
00:14:54.166 --> 00:14:55.100
Pikachu.

265
00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:01.500
Hey, isn't that...

266
00:15:10.533 --> 00:15:14.200
Goodra!

267
00:15:14.266 --> 00:15:17.166
- Ash. Sliggoo evolved!
- Yeah.

268
00:15:17.233 --> 00:15:19.766
- Isn't it awesome?
- I wouldn't say that.

269
00:15:19.833 --> 00:15:21.133
- War!
- Hooray!

270
00:15:23.966 --> 00:15:27.766
- Look!
- Whoa. That's quite a Rain Dance...

271
00:15:29.833 --> 00:15:34.266
Goodra. The Dragon Pokémon and the evolved form of Sliggoo.

272
00:15:34.333 --> 00:15:35.700
Goodra is very friendly,

273
00:15:35.766 --> 00:15:39.266
and one of its hugs can cover its trainer with a sticky slime.

274
00:15:39.333 --> 00:15:41.600
Goodra.

275
00:15:41.666 --> 00:15:44.233
Awesome! You're amazing, Goodra!

276
00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:46.933
Not again. The flat hair is back!

277
00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:49.833
Maybe, but better flat hair than a fat lip.

278
00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:54.400
- Say, Goodra would be a nice catch.
- How rude can you get?

279
00:15:54.466 --> 00:15:57.666
Goodra, lesson time! Now, Pumpkaboo, Dark Pulse!

280
00:15:57.733 --> 00:16:01.333
- Ka-ka-kaboo!
- Take it away, Inkay! Psybeam!

281
00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:03.900
Inkay!

282
00:16:04.033 --> 00:16:07.100
Goo...dra!

283
00:16:07.166 --> 00:16:09.433
-Goodra, great!

284
00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:12.600
And now, it's your turn! Dragon Breath, let's go!

285
00:16:12.666 --> 00:16:15.500
Goodra!

286
00:16:18.633 --> 00:16:20.766
We're blasting off again!

287
00:16:20.833 --> 00:16:22.700
- Wobbuffet!
- Kaboo!

288
00:16:22.766 --> 00:16:23.800
Inkay!

289
00:16:26.166 --> 00:16:27.666
Bye, bye!

290
00:16:27.733 --> 00:16:32.000
Hey Ash, that wasn't Dragon Breath at all! That was Dragon Pulse!

291
00:16:33.366 --> 00:16:36.300
That's so cool that you learned how to use Dragon Pulse!

292
00:16:36.366 --> 00:16:37.733
That's awesome!

293
00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:39.566
Pika, pika.

294
00:16:39.633 --> 00:16:41.766
Ash! Heh.

295
00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:47.700
Ah. That's the first time I've seen a Sliggoo evolve into a Goodra.

296
00:16:47.766 --> 00:16:50.133
- Pretty slick, huh?
- Huh?

297
00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:53.466
- Goo.
- It trained super hard and got stronger.

298
00:16:53.533 --> 00:16:57.766
- It won't lose to anyone again!
- Makes sense to me.

299
00:16:59.266 --> 00:17:02.966
Goodra, you're a lucky Pokémon to have a trainer like Ash.

300
00:17:03.033 --> 00:17:06.566
- Goodra!
- Hold on. We haven't had our battle.

301
00:17:06.633 --> 00:17:09.300
- What do you say, Tierno?
- Pika, pika.

302
00:17:09.366 --> 00:17:11.733
Yeah. Let's go!

303
00:17:18.866 --> 00:17:21.466
All right, Pikachu, use Quick Attack!

304
00:17:21.533 --> 00:17:24.700
- Pika!
- War!

305
00:17:24.766 --> 00:17:27.300
Wartortle, use the recoil to spin!

306
00:17:29.566 --> 00:17:31.633
Quick, dodge it!

307
00:17:31.733 --> 00:17:34.400
War, Wartortle!

308
00:17:35.166 --> 00:17:38.766
- Raichu, aim Charge Beam at Goodra!
- Raichu!

309
00:17:38.833 --> 00:17:41.433
All right, Goodra, use Bide!

310
00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:45.933
Goo-oo-oo-oodra.

311
00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:51.733
- All right, keep pushing! Focus Blast!
- Rai, Raichu!

312
00:17:57.300 --> 00:18:01.400
Goodra's tough! A bit slow, but its endurance is first-rate!

313
00:18:01.466 --> 00:18:03.733
Now, Raichu, Focus Blast one more time!

314
00:18:03.866 --> 00:18:05.800
Rai, Raichu!

315
00:18:05.866 --> 00:18:09.166
- Pikachu, intercept it with Electro Ball!
- Pika, pika!

316
00:18:09.233 --> 00:18:11.900
Help Raichu! Rapid Spin!

317
00:18:11.966 --> 00:18:14.566
- Pika!
- Wartortle!

318
00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:24.033
- Get ready, Wartortle! Use Hydro Pump!
- Wartortle!

319
00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:27.200
- Iron Tail!
- Pika!

320
00:18:29.533 --> 00:18:31.666
That's so cool!

321
00:18:31.733 --> 00:18:34.066
War...

322
00:18:34.133 --> 00:18:36.200
I thought we had you beat. I guess not.

323
00:18:36.266 --> 00:18:38.200
- Pika.
- Goodra.

324
00:18:38.266 --> 00:18:41.033
All right. It's time to use some rhythm!

325
00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:44.033
- War, war.
- Rai!

326
00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.833
Tortle, tortle.

327
00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:49.033
Warrrrrrr!

328
00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.600
Wartortle, use Skull Bash on Goodra, now!

329
00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:54.500
Wartortle!

330
00:18:54.566 --> 00:18:57.433
All right! Hold it there!

331
00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:00.466
Wartortle? War, war, Wartortle.

332
00:19:00.533 --> 00:19:01.900
Raichu, help out!

333
00:19:01.966 --> 00:19:05.766
- Focus Blast!
- Electro Ball, quick!

334
00:19:05.833 --> 00:19:09.133
- Pika, pika, pika!
- Raichu!

335
00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:12.266
- Goodra!
- Goodra, throw Wartortle!

336
00:19:12.333 --> 00:19:17.000
- Goo! Goo! Goodra!
- Tortle! Tor! War!

337
00:19:17.066 --> 00:19:19.500
War, war...

338
00:19:19.566 --> 00:19:21.300
Keep up the beat! Get moving!

339
00:19:21.433 --> 00:19:24.366
Wartortle.. Ugh!

340
00:19:24.433 --> 00:19:25.866
They lost their rhythm!

341
00:19:25.933 --> 00:19:29.633
Pikachu. Use Thunderbolt on Wartortle, let's go!

342
00:19:29.833 --> 00:19:31.733
Pikachu!

343
00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:34.066
Goodra! Dragon Pulse on Raichu!

344
00:19:34.133 --> 00:19:37.700
Goodra!

345
00:19:42.433 --> 00:19:46.533
- Oh! Wartortle! And Raichu!
- We did it!

346
00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:48.000
We won the battle.

347
00:19:48.066 --> 00:19:49.200
- Yeah!
- Pika!

348
00:19:49.266 --> 00:19:50.833
Goodra!

349
00:19:54.933 --> 00:19:56.533
Thanks a lot, Tierno.

350
00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:58.433
We did some great training cos of you.

351
00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:01.900
I want you to battle the Lumiose City Gym just like today.

352
00:20:01.966 --> 00:20:04.900
Right! And next time I see you, let's battle again!

353
00:20:04.966 --> 00:20:08.166
You got it! Say hi to Clemont for me, will you?

354
00:20:08.233 --> 00:20:11.666
- Hm. Take care of yourself, Tierno!
- Denne!

355
00:20:11.733 --> 00:20:16.700
- And say hi to Shauna and Trevor, too!
- Will do! Stay well everybody!

356
00:20:20.566 --> 00:20:24.033
I see it! I see it!

357
00:20:25.066 --> 00:20:27.566
There it is. We finally made it.

358
00:20:27.633 --> 00:20:29.100
Lumiose City!

359
00:20:29.166 --> 00:20:31.833
Clemont, here we come. Won't be long now!

360
00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:32.933
Pika, pika!

361
00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:38.166
As the glittering lights of Lumiose City illuminate the night sky,

362
00:20:38.233 --> 00:20:42.033
there's no doubt Ash is wondering what kind of Gym Battle against Clemont

363
00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:47.600
awaits him at the Lumiose City Gym, as our heroes' journey continues!
